  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-12-03T19:46:41.741Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hey, so, another post here. I am a very old player on this community, since 2017 when vrchat was small and everything, so at that point i wasn't worried about this, but since its been 2 years, and i still see the same unprotected ways of how vrchat keeps track of their avatars and worlds. I have hundreds of avatars, and around 10 worlds, where i modeled stuff from scratch, and to see that they can be ripped out of vrchat this easy yet, kinda makes me feel unsure about spending my time developing things... If anyone from the team is not sure what exactly im talking about, or how, please just message me, i will be more than happy to show exactly how people have been ripping stuff... I know its a game where you will always be able to steal other people's stuff, all i ask is to make it hard :(\n\nThanks, and Merry Christmas!",
